# Document Accept flow (preview PDF → terms → original)

**Status:** Implemented (HydrogenRO). Wire AMC/warranty the same way when needed. Test locally; do **not** merge to main / Netlify-deploy unless asked.

## Agreed product flow

1. CRM generates a **PREVIEW** PDF (watermarked “PREVIEW – NOT VALID”).
2. Cold WhatsApp **DOCUMENT** template sends preview PDF + **Accept** button (real Meta URL button, not body-only link).
3. Customer taps **Accept** → opens brand site `/c/{token}` (Hydrogen or Eleven).
4. Page: summary + strong “preview only / not original” copy → terms checkbox → **Accept**.
5. Server validates token → saves audit → status `accepted` (single-use claim).
6. Send **ORIGINAL** PDF on WhatsApp (seal + authenticity hash + confirmation id).
7. **Do not store PDF bytes forever** — original briefly on private R2 (`whatsapp/accept/…`), deleted after accept; DB keeps hash + audit only.

